ProsperoSunshine: describe the running sessions for the app's list of streams

The control socket's STREAMS shows who streams: each session's client, address, what it asked for, when it started
and how many virtual gamepads it has. rtsp_stream::session_infos() collects them under the server's session lock.
stream::session::start() records the address, the start time and the input under a lock of the session's own, since
the control socket reads them from another thread. ENDSTREAM ends one device's sessions with terminate_sessions_by_cert,
as patch 0012 does for /cancel.

